MASTER EXECUTION PLANNING PROMPT — Generate and maintain exec-planning.md

Act as principal architect, technical program manager, staff full-stack engineer, AI/ML engineer, DevSecOps engineer, data engineer, growth automation engineer, and SRE for the Affiliate Automation OS.

