EXECUTION CONTRACT
Each item:
ID, Title, Priority, Status, Dependencies, Owner, Scope, Non-goals, Acceptance Criteria, Tests, Security, Observability, Documentation, Verification Evidence.
Statuses TODO, IN_PROGRESS, BLOCKED, VERIFYING, COMPLETE, DEFERRED.
Never mark COMPLETE without evidence.

