MASTER SECURITY GATES
auth, authorization, tenant isolation, CSRF, XSS, SQL injection prevention, SSRF, safe redirects, webhooks, encrypted creds, least privilege, rate limits, audit, secure media, prompt/tool isolation.

MASTER TEST MATRIX
Unit, Integration, API, DB, Provider Contract, OAuth, Webhook, Queue, Retry, Idempotency, Tenant Isolation, Security, Media, AI, Publishing, Attribution, Analytics, E2E, Load, Backup/Restore.

DEFINITION OF DONE
Code, tests, passing verification, lint/typecheck/security, tenant isolation, failure behavior, observability, docs, migration review, CI evidence.

AUTONOMOUS EXECUTION LOOP
Inspect repo/branch/PR/CI → read exec-planning → choose highest priority bounded unblocked item → verify deps → mark IN_PROGRESS → tests first → implement minimum → focused tests → regression/security → docs → evidence → COMPLETE/BLOCKED/VERIFYING → report exact next item → STOP.

PROVIDER VERIFICATION
Before implementing TikTok, Shopee, Meta, YouTube, verify current official docs, permissions, eligibility, rate limits, webhooks, publishing limits, regional limits, affiliate capability, last_verified_at. Never invent API support.

RELEASE MILESTONES
M0 Secure Foundation
M1 Affiliate MVP
M2 Content Factory
M3 Multi-Platform Publisher
M4 Revenue Intelligence
M5 Automation
M6 Optimization
M7 Production

FIRST EXECUTION
Inspect repo/git/open work/CI, inventory architecture, compare against plan, update exec-planning/checklist/roadmap/architecture/security/threat-model, determine highest-priority bounded P0 task, implement it tests-first where practical, verify, update evidence, report next item, STOP.
